    "title": "This pastor is barred from returning to the U.S. He still leads a church in Wisconsin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aleja Hertzler-McCain ,\n2 days ago FOND DU LAC, Wis. (RNS) — It's just after 8 p.m. on Saturday night, and it's time for the Rev. Esdras Paredes to give his sermon. But the pastor isn't there. While the team at Ven y Descansarás (Come and You Will Find Rest) scrambles to fix Paredes'internet connection, people at the Pentecostal church in Fond du Lac, Wis., part of the Church of God denomination, are asked to get up and greet each other. Read full article",
